href=3D"http://www.matlus.com/images/FirstWebService4.jpg"=20
            target=3D_blank rel=3Dnofollow><IMG src=3D"" border=3D0></A> =
<BR><B>Figure=20
            2: Showing the WebService Importer Wizard</B> </P>
            <P>In the <CODE>WSDL Location</CODE> field, type in the URL =
for the=20
            WSDL File for the Send an Email WebService. This should be=20
            =
<CODE>http://webservices.matlus.com/scripts/emailwebservice.dll/wsdl/IEma=
ilService</CODE>.=20
            Once you've done that (make sure the URL you type in is =
exactly as=20
            shown), click on the <CODE>Generate</CODE> button. Delphi =
will now=20
            create a new unit for you and the Interface declaration for =
the Send=20
            an Email WebService. This unit will look like this: </P>
