href=3D"http://www.matlus.com/images/FirstWebService2.jpg"=20
            target=3D_blank rel=3Dnofollow><IMG src=3D"" border=3D0></A> =
<BR><B>Figure=20
            3: Showing the Object Inspector with the THTTPRIO =
component's=20
            properties populated.</B> </P>
            <P>Looking at the parameters required by the =
<CODE>SendMail</CODE>=20
            method of the <CODE>IEmailService</CODE>, I've built a =
simple GUI=20
            with the required fields as show in <B>Figure 3</B> below. =
</P>
