  /* This is a Generic validation method that iterates over all the =
controls in the ctrlaArray. If all validation methods return true, this =
method returns true otherwise it returns false. */
  /* Assumptions: */
  /*              The controls that need to be validated have a =
"required" attribute.=20
                  The controls that have a required attribute also have =
a "validate" attribute whose value is set to the name of a javascript =
(validation) method.
                  The "validation" method expects the control as a =
